{"unit_id":"Nicolas-One__dsh-llm-sub2api-dsml#card-zh","repo":"Nicolas-One/dsh-llm-sub2api-dsml","commit":"20973c9e76bd0df585c5784d29717c8a8109b6ce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-sub2api-dsml 是一个 DSH 模型流兼容插件：它在 LLM 流事件中识别 DeepSeek 模型输出的 DSML 工具调用，将完整调用按当前工具 schema 校验后转换成 DSH 原生工具事件。它支持流分片中的调用解析、多个工具调用、孤立 DSML 闭合标签清理，并保留由 DSH 负责的权限检查和工具执行。适合通过已有 provider 使用 DeepSeek 模型、需要恢复文本或 reasoning 中工具调用的 DSH 用户。需要已配置的 LLM provider 和模型 ID 中含 DeepSeek；不需额外 API key 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-37","stream.js:63-89","parser.js:39-74","cordis.patch.yml:2-7"]}
{"unit_id":"Nicolas-One__dsh-llm-sub2api-dsml#card-en","repo":"Nicolas-One/dsh-llm-sub2api-dsml","commit":"20973c9e76bd0df585c5784d29717c8a8109b6ce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-llm-sub2api-dsml converts complete DSML calls in DeepSeek model streams into native DSH tool events after validating arguments against the current tool schema. It handles streamed chunks and orphaned closing tags. Use it with an existing provider and a model ID containing DeepSeek.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-37","stream.js:63-89","parser.js:39-74","cordis.patch.yml:2-7"]}
